add('selection3',7,'Geometry',['homothety','directed angles'],'Parallel-side homotheties and cyclic quadrilaterals identify a homothety centre on both circumcircles.','selection',3,r'Parallel lines $\ell_i$ meet $BC,CA,AB$ at $X_i,Y_i,Z_i$ ($i=1,2$). The perpendiculars to these respective sidelines through $X_i,Y_i,Z_i$ form nondegenerate triangles $T_i$. Prove that their circumcircles are tangent.',page=7)
